# Load ONLY into a repo with "Enable consistency checks" = true
# (OWL2-RL / OWL-Max rulesets). Each triple set should make the
# commit fail with a consistency violation. Test them one at a time.
@prefix ex:  <http://example.org/uni#> .
@prefix owl: <http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#> .

# 1) disjointness: ex:Person owl:disjointWith ex:Course
ex:zeno a ex:Person , ex:Course .

# 2) functional property + differentFrom
# ex:mario ex:hasMainSupervisor ex:p1 , ex:p2 .
# ex:p1 owl:differentFrom ex:p2 .

# 3) disjointness reached only via inference (range of ex:teaches)
# ex:ugo a ex:Student .
# ex:alice ex:teaches ex:ugo .
